            "review_title": "Review at Kim Dy Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Riderdiver\nSylmar59 contributions\n0\nTry it you will like it\nJul 2023 • Couples\nAn Easy Rider recommended to me after a jog along the river. We come to Danang a lot. It was pretty good food for the price. Good portions. I had duck rice, the duck had good flavour and not fatty. Not real juicy but very meaty. The Ca Kho was really tasty and my Hue wife liked it. The bitter melon and egg dish came out hot. Only downside is not a lot of tables, so just wait you will not be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 6, 2023",
