            "review_text": "Jerzy G\nOlsztyn, Poland1782 contributions\n0\nTasty food at decent price\nDec 2018 • Couples\nThis small place has reasonably priced tasty foods that should satisfy different preferences. We found the place just walking the street and the flavours attracted us. We returned for three evening meals. The quality of food was very good. The service as in such a place - with feeling for the guests. Recommended if you want aq decent, tasty, quiet meal at a reasonable price. There is also the take away possibility...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 25, 2019",
