            "review_title": "Review at Kim Dy Restaurant",
            "review_text": "seoulandworld\nSouth Korea14 contributions\n0\nGood food, Great Value\nSep 2018 • Couples\nFood tasted good, many kinds of Chines style stir fried dishes and some Vietnamese style foods. Everything is reasonably priced, around 2USD-3USD each, and local bottled beer is 12000VND, which is... about 50cents or so. Two of us had 5 dishes and one beer, and the cost was 170,000VND. Great value for money, highly recommended if you are staying around this area.\n中華風の炒め物やフォーなど5品とビールを注文して食べましたが、どれも美味しかったです。合計17万ドンでした。近くのホテルに宿泊しているなら、おすすめのレストランです。\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 1, 2018",
